 "name_en": "Predictive Accounting for Travel and Expense Management (4Q0)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Predictive Accounting for Travel and Expense Management (4Q0)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiodbf1f8c18b3b4d678e70c32e0f3dea85\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiodbf1f8c18b3b4d678e70c32e0f3dea85__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">Use the integration between Travel and Expense Management in SAP Concur and Finance in <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> to forecast the impact of your employees' business trips on the budget planned and allocated to cost centers or projects.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiodbf1f8c18b3b4d678e70c32e0f3dea85__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create travel request in SAP Concur</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create a predictive journal entry automatically in <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> including commitment creation (cost center or project budget check, if activated)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create expense reports with reference to the travel request in SAP Concur</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Post expense reports automatically and reduce commitment</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiodbf1f8c18b3b4d678e70c32e0f3dea85__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Integrate travel requests between SAP Concur and <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span></li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Use a deeply integrated travel request process with commitments and automatic budget check functionality</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Extend the reach of traditional accounting</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>差旅和费用管理的预测会计 (4Q0)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiodbf1f8c18b3b4d678e70c32e0f3dea85\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiodbf1f8c18b3b4d678e70c32e0f3dea85__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">使用 SAP Concur 中的差旅和费用管理与 SAP <span class=\"ph pname\">S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 财务之间的集成预测员工差旅对计划和分配到成本中心或项目的预算的影响。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiodbf1f8c18b3b4d678e70c32e0f3dea85__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">在 SAP Concur 中创建差旅申请</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 中自动创建预测日记账分录，包括承诺创建（成本中心或项目预算检查，如果激活）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">参考 SAP Concur 中的差旅申请创建费用报表</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">自动过账费用报表并减少承诺</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiodbf1f8c18b3b4d678e70c32e0f3dea85__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">集成 SAP Concur 和 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 之间的差旅申请</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用深度集成的差旅申请流程，其中包含承诺和自动预算检查功能</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">扩展传统会计的覆盖范围</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
